    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m"{% if termsWithAnchors %} id="reporting-security-breaches" tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>How to report a security breach</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">To report a security issue, go to <a class="govuk-link" href="https://justiceuk.sharepoint.com/sites/HMPPSIntranet/SitePages/Information-security--report-a-data-loss(1).aspx?web=1&amp;or=WORD-WEB.BODY.NT&amp;ct=1791894596355&amp;ct=1791896973781" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">how to report security breaches</a> on the intranet or telephone 020 3334 4502.</p>

